        }
    }
}
```

In this unit test, we assume we have an ArrayList and a valid index. We then make an assumption that this index exists in the ArrayList during state transition. Please bear in mind this will be more helpful if your index is random and you want to ensure that.

After running the operation `arrList[index]`, we observe the count of ArrayList before and after the operation, as well as the value that is returned and whether it's contained in the ArrayList after the operation.

This will make it clearer in your unit test reporting whether the index you have assumed exists in the ArrayList or not.

